## 6. Repo Method JSDoc + Barrel Export

Mỗi repo method public **PHẢI** có JSDoc: **mục đích** (feature/tab/step nào), **filter chính**,
**idempotent?** (write methods), **index hint** nếu query phụ thuộc index cụ thể.

```typescript
/**
 * Aggregate players cho 1 draw × 1 tenant. Drill cấp 3 trong financial reports.
 *
 * BẮT BUỘC drawId + tenantId — KHÔNG query cross-draw.
 * Index: { drawId: 1, "tenant.tenantId": 1, accountId: 1 }
 */
async aggregatePlayersByDrawAndTenant(drawId: string, tenantId: string): Promise<PlayerBreakdownRow[]>
```

`repos/index.ts` export: (1) tất cả Repository classes, (2) re-export types từ `types/` barrel.

```typescript
export type * from "./types";
export { BaseRepo } from "./base-repo";
export { DrawRepository } from "./draw-repo";
export { EntryRepository } from "./entry-repo";
```

